नि-शामन, अम्, n. sight, seeing; looking at,
beholding; looking at repeatedly; observing, hearing;
a shadow, reflection.

निशि नि-शि [cf. नि-शो], cl. 5. P. A. -शिनोति,
-नुते, -शेतुम्, to sharpen; to stimulate, excite;
to kill.

निश्चेष्ट निश्-चेष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, motionless,
powerless, helpless; incapable of motion or effort;
(अम्), ind. without motion.

नि-षेक, अस्, m. sprinkling, infusion, aspersion;
distilling; effusion; seminal infusion, impregnation;
the ceremony performed upon impregnation; irriga-
tion; water for washing, (but according to others)
seminal impurity; what is poured upon the ground,
dirty water, swill.

निषेव् नि-षेव् (नि-सेव्), cl. 1. A. -षेवते,
-षेवितुम्, to wait upon, serve, attend, follow;
attach or devote one's self to; to honour, worship,
adore; to pursue, practise, perform, observe, cultivate;
to frequent, inhabit, visit; to enjoy; to employ.

निष्कण्टक निष्-कण्टक, अस्, आ, अम्, =
अ-कण्टक, thornless, free from thorns or enemies;
free from danger or trouble.

निष्कर्मन् निष्-कर्मन्, आ, आ, अ, inactive;
exempt from or neglecting religious or worldly
acts, &c.

निष्कुट निष्-कुट, अस्, m. a pleasure-grove
near a house, (in this sense also अम्, n.); a field;
the hollow of a tree [cf. निष्-कुह]; a door; the
female apartments, Zenana; N. of a country (?);
(अम्), n., N. of a hole of a peculiar form in the
frame of a bedstead; (also read निः-कुह.)

निष्-केवल्य, अस्, आ, अम्, belonging exclusively;
N. of a particular Uktha (q. v.) connected with the
midday oblation and belonging to Indra exclusively.

निष्टानक नि-ष्टानक, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्तन्
with नि = निस्), roar, murmur, murmuring, rustling;
(अस्, आ, अम्), speaking loud; causing to cry.

निष्टुर् निष्-टुर्, ऊर्, ऊर्, ऊर् (fr. rt. तॄ with
निस्), Ved. one who has no conqueror, unconquered;
(Sāy.) an overcomer of enemies.

निष्-पिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, ground, pounded, pul-
verized, bruised, crushed, reduced to dust or powder;
beaten, oppressed.

निष्-पेष, अस्, m. or निष्-पेषण, अम्, n.
rubbing together, grinding, pulverizing, bruising;
striking, clashing, hitting or throwing against; the
noise or sound produced by striking or clashing;
[cf. नैष्पेषिक.]

निष्प्रचार निष्-प्रचार, अस्, आ, अम्, not
going or moving away, remaining in one's place;
concentrated or fixed upon one point (as mind).

निसिन्धु नि-सिन्धु, उस्, or निसिन्धुक, अस्,
m. a species of shrub, Vitex Negundo (= निर्गुण्डी);
[cf. सिन्धु, सिन्धुक, सिन्धु-वार.]
